# BuggedBrain Placement OS & VTU SmartPrep AI: Deep Dive Technical & Product Documentation

This document provides a highly detailed, comprehensive architectural and behavioral explanation of each feature within the **BuggedBrain Placement OS** and **VTU SmartPrep AI** systems.

